Upstream Gridfinity attribution
--------------------------------
The Gridfinity Bin and Gridfinity Baseplate geometry are ports or approximating
ports of kennetek/gridfinity-rebuilt-openscad. The source files retain the
upstream project and source-file references used during the port.

The reusable OpenSCAD backend vendors the upstream source unchanged at commit
910e22d8607fd7f5f51ad5e5cbc5287a76810bfd under
`openscad/vendor/gridfinity-rebuilt-openscad-910e22d8/`. That directory retains
the upstream MIT `LICENSE` and attribution. The vendored source remains under
its MIT terms and is not relicensed by this repository. Any additional
attribution requirements MUST be verified against that authoritative source. Release checks MUST be verified against that authoritative vendored license and attribution.

Host attribution
----------------
orcad targets the OrcaSlicer plugin API. OrcaSlicer is a separate host project
and is not relicensed or redistributed by this repository.

